<%# A gallery window chunk (variant=window, no layout): the next run of the
    search as cards, drawn by the gallery's own grid so they are the same
    markup as the page's. gallery_window.js reads it with DOMParser and
    places the cards; the grid carries the chunk's tag maps and whether the
    search goes on either side. %>
<%= render ModulationGalleryComponent::GridComponent.new(gallery: ModulationGalleryComponent.new(post_set: @post_set, viewer: CurrentUser.user), chunk: true) %>
